{"title":"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Josh and Mike live <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/0/030e19e4e2f1c074127cb50581e8496470c5419f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> miles apart. Yesterday Josh started to ride his bicycle toward Mike's house. A little later Mike started to ride his bicycle toward Josh's house. When they met, Josh had ridden for twice the length of time as Mike and at four-fifths of Mike's rate. How many miles had Mike ridden when they met?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/3/3b3d0172f5a2670832850f153824e3f8eaa9614f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\mathrm {A}) \\ 4 \\qquad (\\mathrm {B}) \\ 5 \\qquad (\\mathrm {C})\\ 6 \\qquad (\\mathrm {D}) \\ 7 \\qquad (\\mathrm {E})\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"342\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/4/be442cee75d89de821f680e247a75069778a8128.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D_J, D_M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" /> be the distances traveled by Josh and Mike, respectively, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/e/4aea8299833063da29109b777d3d9d5c7a7db388.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r,t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" /> be the time and rate of Mike. Using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/3/953f29a2b6ad8f2c5d0a2c619a084c4d6896600e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = rt$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/7/fe7afadb467612ae835aa36c29f20fb7d927a31f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D_M = rt$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"68\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/d/38da92088e545ddab2a8b55c0eaeabecaa95edcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D_J = \\left(\\frac{4}{5}r\\right)\\left(2t\\right) = \\frac 85rt$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"181\" height=\"43\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b4b3628afd9b1289b7bbbf51178419cb3cf826.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13 = D_M + D_J = rt + \\frac{8}{5}rt = \\frac{13}{5}rt$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"272\" height=\"38\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/5/5d55bee15c9c7b91a5ad4173142098883537078d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Longrightarrow rt = D_M = 5\\ \\mathrm{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"168\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A\">2005 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2005 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"dis